# Pedoman Pengembangan — Wisata Sijunjung Rancak

Dokumen ini adalah **acuan wajib** bagi AI (Antigravity) selama pengembangan aplikasi **wisata.sijunjung.go.id**, menggunakan stack **Laravel 12 + Filament v4 + Livewire 3**.

---

## 1. Stack Teknologi

| Komponen          | Versi / Detail               |
| ----------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Framework         | Laravel 12.x                 |
| Admin Panel       | Filament v4                  |
| Reactive UI       | Livewire 4.x + Alpine.js     |
| CSS               | Tailwind CSS                 |
| Database          | MySQL / MariaDB              |
| PHP               | 8.2+                         |
| Auth              | Laravel Sanctum (API mobile) |
| Role & Permission | Spatie Laravel Permission    |

---

## 2. Konvensi Penamaan

### Database & Model

- Nama tabel: **plural snake_case** dalam **Bahasa Indonesia** → `tempat_wisata`, `virtual_tours`, `atraksi_wisatas`
- Nama model: **PascalCase singular** → `TempatWisata`, `VirtualTour`, `AtraksiWisata`
- Kolom slug: selalu ada di setiap tabel konten publik, `string unique`
- Kolom `is_active`: `boolean`, default `true`; gunakan `scopeActive($query)` di model
- Kolom translasi: suffix `_en` (contoh: `deskripsi_en`, `nama_en`)

### Filament Resource

- Namespace Resource: `App\Filament\Resources\{NamaPlural}\{NamaResource}.php`
    - Contoh: `App\Filament\Resources\AtraksiWisatas\AtraksiWisataResource`
- Pisahkan Form dan Table ke file terpisah:
    - `Schemas/{Nama}Form.php` → class statis `configure(Schema $schema): Schema`
    - `Tables/{Nama}Table.php` → class statis `configure(Table $table): Table`
- Pages: `Pages/List{Nama}.php`, `Pages/Create{Nama}.php`, `Pages/Edit{Nama}.php`

### Livewire Components

- Namespace: `App\Livewire\` untuk halaman utama, `App\Livewire\Wisata\` untuk sub-halaman wisata
- Selalu gunakan attributes: `#[Lazy]`, `#[Layout('layouts.wisata')]`, `#[Title('...')]`
- Selalu sediakan `placeholder()` method yang mengembalikan view skeleton
- Nama view: `resources/views/livewire/wisata/{nama-kebab-case}.blade.php`

---

## 3. Pola Filament v4 yang Wajib Diikuti

### Import Namespace (Filament v4)

```php
// Form Components
use Filament\Forms\Components\FileUpload;
use Filament\Forms\Components\Select;
use Filament\Forms\Components\TextInput;
use Filament\Forms\Components\Textarea;
use Filament\Forms\Components\Toggle;
use Filament\Forms\Components\RichEditor;
use Filament\Forms\Components\Repeater;
use Filament\Forms\Components\Hidden;

// Schema Components (BUKAN Filament\Forms\Components\Section!)
use Filament\Schemas\Components\Grid;
use Filament\Schemas\Components\Group;
use Filament\Schemas\Components\Section;
use Filament\Schemas\Schema;

// Table
use Filament\Tables\Table;
use Filament\Tables\Columns\TextColumn;
use Filament\Tables\Columns\ImageColumn;
use Filament\Tables\Columns\ToggleColumn;
use Filament\Tables\Columns\IconColumn;

// Actions (Filament v4 — dari Filament\Actions, BUKAN Filament\Tables\Actions)
use Filament\Actions\EditAction;
use Filament\Actions\BulkActionGroup;
use Filament\Actions\DeleteBulkAction;

// Resource
use Filament\Resources\Resource;
use Filament\Support\Icons\Heroicon;
use BackedEnum;
```

> ⚠️ **KRITIS:** Di Filament v4, `Section`, `Group`, `Grid` diimport dari `Filament\Schemas\Components`, **bukan** dari `Filament\Forms\Components`. Ini berbeda dari Filament v3.

### Struktur Form Standar (3-kolom)

```php
return $schema->columns(3)->components([
    Group::make()->schema([
        Section::make('Informasi Utama')->schema([...]),
        Section::make('Detail')->schema([...]),
        Section::make('Media')->schema([...]),
    ])->columnSpan(2),

    Group::make()->schema([
        Section::make('Status & Kategori')->schema([...]),
        Section::make('Lokasi')->schema([...]),
    ])->columnSpan(1),
]);
```

### Struktur Table Standar

```php
return $table
    ->columns([...])
    ->filters([...])
    ->recordActions([EditAction::make()])
    ->toolbarActions([BulkActionGroup::make([DeleteBulkAction::make()])]);
```

### Slug Auto-generate di Form

```php
TextInput::make('nama')
    ->required()
    ->live(onBlur: true)
    ->afterStateUpdated(fn($state, callable $set) => $set('slug', \Illuminate\Support\Str::slug($state))),
TextInput::make('slug')->hidden()->dehydrated(),
```

### Upload Gambar Standar

```php
FileUpload::make('gambar')
    ->label('Foto Utama')
    ->image()
    ->optimize('webp')
    ->disk('public')
    ->directory('{nama-folder}')
    ->imageEditor()
    ->imageEditorAspectRatios(['16:9', '4:3', '1:1'])
    ->acceptedFileTypes(['image/jpeg', 'image/jpg', 'image/png', 'image/webp'])
    ->maxSize(2048)
    ->helperText('Max 2MB. Format: JPEG, JPG, PNG, WEBP')
    ->columnSpanFull(),
```

### Navigasi Resource

```php
protected static string|BackedEnum|null $navigationIcon = Heroicon::OutlinedMapPin;
protected static string|\UnitEnum|null $navigationGroup = 'Wisata';
protected static ?int $navigationSort = 2;
protected static ?string $modelLabel = 'Nama Singular';
protected static ?string $pluralModelLabel = 'Nama Plural';
```

---

## 4. Pola Model yang Wajib Diikuti

```php
class NamaModel extends Model
{
    use HasFactory;
    use HasTranslations; // Jika ada kolom _en (translasi)

    protected $table = 'nama_tabel';

    protected $fillable = ['nama', 'slug', 'deskripsi', 'gambar', 'is_active', 'tempat_wisata_id', 'user_id'];

    protected $casts = [
        'is_active' => 'boolean',
        'gallery'   => 'array',
    ];

    // Auto slug (jika tidak di-generate oleh form)
    protected static function boot()
    {
        parent::boot();
        static::saving(function ($model) {
            if (empty($model->slug)) {
                $model->slug = \Illuminate\Support\Str::slug($model->nama);
            }
        });
    }

    // Relasi wajib
    public function tempatWisata() { return $this->belongsTo(TempatWisata::class); }
    public function user()         { return $this->belongsTo(User::class); }

    // Scope standar
    public function scopeActive($query) { return $query->where('is_active', true); }
}
```

---

## 5. Pola Livewire Component

```php
#[Lazy]
#[Layout('layouts.wisata')]
#[Title('Judul Halaman - Sijunjung Rancak')]
class NamaComponent extends Component
{
    public $slug;
    public $data;

    public function mount($slug)
    {
        $this->data = NamaModel::with(['relasi'])->where('slug', $slug)->active()->firstOrFail();
    }

    public function render()
    {
        return view('livewire.wisata.nama-view');
    }

    public function placeholder()
    {
        return view('livewire.skeletons.wisata.wisata-detail');
    }
}
```

---

## 6. Hak Akses / Role

| Role               | Akses                                               |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `super_admin`      | Semua data semua resource                           |
| `pengelola_wisata` | Hanya data milik sendiri (`user_id = auth()->id()`) |

### Filter Query di Resource

```php
public static function getEloquentQuery(): \Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Builder
{
    $query = parent::getEloquentQuery()->with(['relasi']);
    if (auth()->user()->hasRole('super_admin')) return $query;
    return $query->where('user_id', auth()->id());
}
```

### Filter di Select Relationship Form

```php
Select::make('tempat_wisata_id')
    ->relationship(
        name: 'tempatWisata',
        titleAttribute: 'nama',
        modifyQueryUsing: fn($query) => auth()->user()->hasRole('super_admin')
            ? $query
            : $query->where('user_id', auth()->id()),
    )
    ->searchable()->preload()->required(),
```

---

## 7. API untuk Aplikasi Mobile (`wisata_mobile`)

- File: `routes/api.php`
- Controller: `app/Http/Controllers/Api/`
- Autentikasi: Laravel Sanctum (`auth:sanctum`)
- Response standar: `response()->json(['data' => ..., 'message' => ...])`
- Endpoint publik (tidak perlu login): daftar & detail konten publik
- Endpoint terproteksi: mutasi data (POST/PUT/DELETE)

---

## 8. Multilingualisme

Trait `HasTranslations` (`app/Traits/HasTranslations.php`) menyediakan magic getter untuk kolom `_en`:

- `$model->nama` → otomatis return `nama_en` jika locale `en` dan kolom ada
- `$model->deskripsi` → sama untuk deskripsi
- Locale switch via route `/lang/{locale}` (id, en, ja, zh, ar)

---

## 9. Alur Kerja AI

1. **Analisis** → Baca model, migration, dan resource yang sudah ada sebagai referensi pola
2. **Perencanaan** → Buat `implementation_plan.md` untuk perubahan yang melibatkan schema database atau arsitektur
3. **Eksekusi** → Ikuti konvensi di dokumen ini secara ketat; gunakan `php artisan make:` bila memungkinkan
4. **Verifikasi** → Jalankan `php artisan migrate` dan cek admin panel + frontend

---

## 10. Perintah Artisan yang Sering Digunakan

```bash
# Generate Filament Resource
php artisan make:filament-resource VirtualTour --generate

# Jalankan migasi
php artisan migrate

# Rollback migasi terakhir
php artisan migrate:rollback

# Clear cache
php artisan optimize:clear

# Buat migration baru
php artisan make:migration nama_migration
```

